  "description": "Dine like a Sultan as attentive waiters present culinary treasures crafted by Turkish chefs. Discover Osmanly, the only nouveau Ottoman cuisine restaurant in town, the first treat you’ll receive is a brass pitcher of jasmine water to dip your hands and a warm towel to dry them off the perfect preparation for the delicacies ahead. The shared plate concept allows guests to try a variety of dishes as an introduction to the Middle East’s favourite cuisine. Open daily for lunch and dinner.",
